{{/* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 */}}
{{/* Readiness is historical evidence, never a new capability probe. */}}
{{define "content"}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/support.css">{{with .Data}}{{$d := .}}
<div class="page-interior machine-page">
{{template "guide-show" $}}
<div class="head"><div>{{if $.Tour}}<h2>{{else}}<h1>{{end}}Can this machine enforce rules?{{if $.Tour}}</h2>{{else}}</h1>{{end}}</div></div>
<section class="panel machine-answer" aria-labelledby="machine-answer"><div class="panel-body stack">
<h2 id="machine-answer">{{if .Err}}Readiness unknown{{else if not .Run}}Not checked yet{{else if .Watch}}Watched only in the newest run{{else if .Best}}Current readiness is not checked{{else}}Readiness unknown{{end}}</h2>
<p>{{if and .Best (not .Watch)}}{{tier .Best.Name}} worked in a recorded run. {{end}}{{if .Err}}The newest run's machine facts could not be read.{{else if not .Run}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.runs" "No runs yet. There is no recorded check for this machine." .Numbers)}}{{else if .Watch}}That run watched actions without enforcement.{{else}}These are facts from past runs. They do not check this machine's setup now.{{end}}</p>
<p><strong>First, check the machine:</strong></p><div class="cli"><code>tego machine check</code></div>
<a class="text-link" href="/glossary#protection">What do the protection levels cover?</a>
</div></section>
{{if .Run}}
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="h-tiers"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-tiers">Protection checks</h2></div><div class="machine-checks">
{{range .Tiers}}<details class="machine-check" id="check-{{.Name}}"><summary><span class="check-name">{{tier .Name}}</span><span class="b b-neutral">{{if .Used}}Used before{{else}}Not checked{{end}}</span><span class="phone-when">{{if .Used}}<time datetime="{{iso .Used.Start}}" data-started="{{iso .Used.Start}}" data-number-exclude="machine.tier-time" data-ck>{{when .Used.Start $d.Now}}</time>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.tier-runs" "No run" $d.Numbers)}}{{end}}</span></summary>
<div class="panel-body stack-sm"><p>{{if eq .Name "landlock"}}File and program restrictions can run without administrator rights. Network decisions use Tego's supervisor and may be best effort.{{else if eq .Name "cgroup"}}Adds network checks and file supervision with administrator rights.{{else}}Adds kernel checks with BPF LSM enabled at boot.{{end}}</p>
<p><span data-number-exclude="machine.requirement">{{.Needs}}</span>. {{if .Has}}Recorded in a run at this level or above; check again with <span class="mono">tego machine check</span>.{{else}}{{.Missing}}. Check the doctor's result before changing the machine.{{end}}</p>
{{with .Used}}<a class="text-link" href="/runs/{{pathEsc .ID}}" data-number-exclude="machine.last-run">Last recorded use: {{if .Agent}}{{.Agent}}{{else}}{{.ID}}{{end}}</a>{{end}}</div></details>{{end}}
</div></section>
{{if .Checks}}<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="h-check-limits"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-check-limits">Checks with limits</h2></div>{{range .Checks}}<details class="machine-check"><summary><span class="check-name">{{.Label}}</span><span class="b b-neutral">{{.State}}</span></summary><div class="panel-body stack-sm"><p>{{.Next}}</p><p class="detail-value mono">{{.Flag}}</p></div></details>{{end}}</section>{{end}}
<details class="detail-disclosure" id="machine-record"><summary>Full recorded machine details</summary><div class="panel-body stack">
{{with .Err}}<p class="detail-value">{{.}}</p>{{end}}
<p>From <a class="text-link" href="/runs/{{pathEsc .Run.ID}}" data-number-exclude="machine.source-run">{{.Run.ID}}</a>. {{tier .Tier}}.</p>
<dl class="kv"><dt>Kernel</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{if .Kernel}}Linux {{.Kernel}}{{else}}Not recorded{{end}}</dd><dt>Kernel decides</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{if .Plane}}{{.Plane}}{{else if .Watch}}Watching without enforcement{{else if eq .Tier "landlock"}}Files and programs (Landlock){{else}}Not recorded{{end}}</dd><dt>Network assurance</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{if .NetAssurance}}{{.NetAssurance}}{{else}}Not recorded{{end}}</dd><dt>Proven network checks</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{range .NetGuards}}<div class="mono">{{.}}</div>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.netguards" "None recorded" .Facts)}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Unproven network checks</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{range .NetMissing}}<div class="mono">{{.}}</div>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.netmissing" "None recorded" .Facts)}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Capabilities on</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{range .Caps}}<div class="mono">{{.}}</div>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.caps" "None recorded" .Facts)}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Unavailable</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{range .NoCaps}}<div class="mono">{{.}}</div>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.nocaps" "None recorded" .Facts)}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Best effort</dt><dd class="detail-value">{{range .BestEffort}}<div class="mono">{{.}}</div>{{else}}{{template "quantity" (quantityZero "machine.besteffort" "None recorded" .Facts)}}{{end}}</dd></dl>
<p>For a missing or best effort check, run <span class="mono">tego machine check</span> and follow that check's next step. A past run cannot prove a missing check works now.</p>
</div></details>
{{end}}
</div>{{end}}{{end}}
